zone = "rfix"
name = "H13 fixture — degenerate reset cadence"
start = "rfix.start"
reset_secs = -1
[[entries]]
kind = "room"
id = "rfix.start"
title = "Reset Probe"
---
A room whose zone header authors reset_secs = -1. Before 1.6.8 that produced a
negative interval, which made the elapsed-window test false forever and fired a
zone reset on every tick. Reachable from 1.6.7 onward, when toml_int learned to
read a sign; an authored 0 reached the same place all the way back at M7-A.
